From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pavel Khmelinsky <hmepas@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:33:30 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 10/14] Add proxy SSO desktop-token login to the login screen

When running behind the local proxy (ProxyUpstreamSiteURL set), show a button to open SSO on the real server with a desktop_token and an input to paste the resulting /login/desktop?server_token=... URL so the proxy can authenticate independently without keeping a second server configured in the desktop app.
